- 规则名称: Ternary operators should not be nested
- 问题描述: Extract this nested ternary operation into an independent statement.
- 严重程度: MAJOR
- 文件路径: OpenAuth.Core/OpenAuth.App/Finance/ReturnUnRelNewOrderProcessor.cs
