【问题详情】
- Issue Key: eb636b43-4590-4664-8b69-40894b98b646
- 规则ID: csharpsquid:S3358
- 规则名称: Ternary operators should not be nested
- 问题描述: Extract this nested ternary operation into an independent statement.
- 严重程度: MAJOR
- 文件路径: OpenAuth.Core/OpenAuth.App/Finance/ReturnUnRelNewOrderProcessor.cs
- 报错行号: 93

【SonarQube 精确定位】
- 主定位: OpenAuth.Core/OpenAuth.App/Finance/ReturnUnRelNewOrderProcessor.cs:93:28-133

【SonarQube 规则说明（问题原因/风险）】
Nested ternaries are hard to read and can make the order of operations complex to understand.

public string GetReadableStatus(Job j)
{
  return j.IsRunning ? "Running" : j.HasErrors ? "Failed" : "Succeeded";  // Noncompliant
}

Instead, use another line to express the nested operation in a separate statement.

public string GetReadableStatus(Job j)
{
  if (j.IsRunning)
  {
    return "Running";
  }
  return j.HasErrors ? "Failed" : "Succeeded";
}

【SonarQube 修复建议】
Nested ternaries are hard to read and can make the order of operations complex to understand.

public string GetReadableStatus(Job j)
{
  return j.IsRunning ? "Running" : j.HasErrors ? "Failed" : "Succeeded";  // Noncompliant
}

Instead, use another line to express the nested operation in a separate statement.

public string GetReadableStatus(Job j)
{
  if (j.IsRunning)
  {
    return "Running";
  }
  return j.HasErrors ? "Failed" : "Succeeded";
}

